 Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Project Plan

### Phase 1 – Requirement Collection
- Identify the problem.
- Collect project requirements.
- Identify required features.

### Phase 2 – System Design
- Design project modules.
- Create the system flow.
- Plan data processing methods.

### Phase 3 – Development
- Develop the project using Python.
- Implement income and expense management.
- Implement budget calculation.
- Implement expense analysis.
- Implement AI recommendations.

### Phase 4 – Testing
- Test all modules.
- Check calculations.
- Validate user inputs.
- Test recommendation results.

### Phase 5 – Documentation
- Prepare project documentation.
- Add screenshots and results.
- Prepare the GitHub repository.

## Expected Outcome
A simple AI-based budget assistant that helps users track expenses and receive useful budget recommendations.
